{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id150979827"}, "name":{"label":"GossFitz"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-29T16:10:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11.2"}, "id":{"label":"12246828195"}, "title":{"label":"Simply Brilliant"}, "content":{"label":"I absolutely love this app. As a routine podcast listener this app is a must. I love the use of the queue and playlist creation. The audio control is fantastic, I’m especially a fan of the sleep timer function as I listen to long episodes whilst trying to sleep, finding new stuff is easy and organising your podcasts is simple. \n\nSuch an essential app for any podcast listener. I highly recommend Overcast. Sincerest gratitude to the developer for creating such a useful app that I wouldn’t be without.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id149874144"}, "name":{"label":"Lizzyf23"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-28T00:07:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11.2"}, "id":{"label":"12240094252"}, "title":{"label":"Used to be great"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using overcast for years, but for some reason lately it’s unusable! I start playing a podcast and it just hangs, or plays the first few seconds before skipping to the next podcast. This has been going on for a while now and is so frustrating that I’m switching podcast apps. Please fix it!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
