{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id32430946"}, "name":{"label":"Crudeoyle"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-02T04:14:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11.2"}, "id":{"label":"12135260398"}, "title":{"label":"Bloating Downloads"}, "content":{"label":"Used overcast for about a year. \n\nOverall the player is good but I have just downloaded a new podcast app and stopped using overcast.\n\nThe main issue is the reason I moved from Apple Podcasts to overcast. The app getting bloated using over 19gb of space to store only 1gb of actual downloaded playable podcasts.\nShame really as if it could control/clean its storage usage i wouldn't have moved to a new app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
