{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id15078722"}, "name":{"label":"RemarkableApe"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-12-19T00:27:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11.2"}, "id":{"label":"12080340769"}, "title":{"label":"Used to be pretty good but after update looking for something new"}, "content":{"label":"I don’t think I will keep this much longer. Main reason for using this app is I go running. When I run I make a playlist. But now when you add items to the playlist it randomly removes podcasts and there seems to be no rhyme or reason to it. Shame really as it was an OK app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
