{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id35764631"}, "name":{"label":"John Coxon"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-12-10T17:12:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11.2"}, "id":{"label":"12049218125"}, "title":{"label":"Great for audio processing but mediocre for UI"}, "content":{"label":"This is a great audio engine with a mediocre user interface and a developer who fundamentally doesn’t care to improve it. The price is rising despite multiple UI bugs that still haven’t been addressed since the rewrite, Shortcuts support has always been an afterthought, asking Siri to play things is broken, etc, I still use it because it has the best sound, but I can’t honestly recommend anyone else tries it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
