{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id171709166"}, "name":{"label":"Rugur T"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-25T00:18:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.10.1"}, "id":{"label":"11872157963"}, "title":{"label":"Best in class"}, "content":{"label":"I use this app all the time to listen o my poddys. It’s fast, slick and just works. The bookmarks feature is my favourite aspect, allowing me to skip to sections I want to live. Thank you to the developer for making this app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id152327818"}, "name":{"label":"Gonadbasher"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-24T06:43:13-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.10"}, "id":{"label":"11869485863"}, "title":{"label":"Used to be decent, hard to navigate now"}, "content":{"label":"I used this for over a year after Apple Podcasts started having unsolvable issues. After the most recent update, I can’t find a way to simply allow the next episode to play without adding them to a queue manually. Such a shame because it was great.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id17013184"}, "name":{"label":"Timbo107"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-21T06:47:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11858681027"}, "title":{"label":"Sounds so much better"}, "content":{"label":"The quality of the sound with Smart Speed and Voice Boost enabled is so much better that it makes listening to podcasts a pleasure.  The updated App is a great improvement. Worth paying for Premium to keep this App at the Top.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1355062199"}, "name":{"label":"lilandlois"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-20T18:44:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11857003792"}, "title":{"label":"Love it! The podcast app I’ve been looking for."}, "content":{"label":"Now I’ve got used to it, Overcast is pretty much perfect. I appreciate being able to pin my favourites to the top of my followed list. \nThe UI is intuitive and user friendly. Everything loads immediately, so no waiting for things that never happen or might happen if you wait long enough, try enough times and if you’re lucky (goodbye Apple Podcasts). \nIt works seamlessly with my watch too. \nThank you so much for creating this. I’ve happily gone premium to show my support and appreciation.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id27910435"}, "name":{"label":"worldscaper"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-17T00:42:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11842925503"}, "title":{"label":"The best for a decade. Now worthless"}, "content":{"label":"As is the running theme with all devs in this modern age, Marco woke up one morning, drowning in his own Kool Aid, and decided to utterly screw up his app. \nA decade of it being the single best podcast app, and one of the best written apps in general, and now we have some broken shell of a thing, which is clunky, slow, unintuitive, unstable, and entirely user-unfriendly. \n\nJust…just bravo, dude. You jumped all the sharks…", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id24406847"}, "name":{"label":"slippery_chimp"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-16T22:19:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11842643742"}, "title":{"label":"Only podcast app you need"}, "content":{"label":"Way better than the apple and Spotify apps, everything is available here. Have been using for a few yews, just subscribed since it’s only £8.99 a year - thanks developer 👍", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id130821391"}, "name":{"label":"thegreatchipmunk"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-16T01:18:52-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11839475073"}, "title":{"label":"Great app but having a lot of problems atm"}, "content":{"label":"My podcast app of choice for years. What really sets it apart is the excellent audio playback functionality - features like skipping silences and faster playback just seem to work better and sound more natural than the competition.\n\nThe app had a significant update a few months ago, and I’m still dealing with problems. Every few weeks I need to manually delete downloaded files, as the app seems to bulk download old episodes every now and then. \n\nAt the same time, podcasts I follow never seem to be downloaded in time. Background downloads either don’t trigger or fail half the time.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id165842227"}, "name":{"label":"Skippi666"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-15T13:32:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11837949573"}, "title":{"label":"If it ain’t broke…"}, "content":{"label":"Have used mini podcast apps and this was my favourite. Until that is, the redesign. i’m sure it looks lovely, but the app is now much more cumbersome to use with VoiceOver.  I hope that the developer finds time to address these issues, as in the past, they have been very receptive to accessibility feedback.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}], "updated":{"label":"2026-10-03T16:33:06-07:00"}, "rights":{"label":"Copyright 2008 Apple Inc."}, "title":{"label":"iTunes Store: Customer Reviews"}, "icon":{"label":"http://itunes.apple.com/favicon.ico"}, "link":[
